        "# Question 8: Create a LlamaIndex implementation that indexes a local text file and retrieves answers from it.\n",
        "\"\"\"### Explanation\n",
        "\n",
        "1. **File creation:** A text file containing company information is created inside Google Colab.\n",
        "2. **Data loading:** `SimpleDirectoryReader` reads the text file.\n",
        "3. **Indexing:** `VectorStoreIndex` creates an index to search the document efficiently.\n",
        "4. **Retrieval:** The query engine finds information relevant to the user's question.\n",
        "5. **Answer generation:** The Hugging Face model uses the retrieved context to generate an answer.\n",
        "\n",
        "### Conclusion\n",
        "\n",
        "LlamaIndex simplifies document indexing and information retrieval. By combining it with a language model, users can ask questions about local text files and receive answers based on their contents.\"\"\"\n",
        "## Answer\n",
        "\n",
        "!pip install -q llama-index-core llama-index-readers-file llama-index-llms-huggingface llama-index-embeddings-huggingface transformers accelerate sentence-transformers\n",
        "\n",
        "from pathlib import Path\n",
        "from llama_index.core import (\n",
        "    SimpleDirectoryReader,\n",
        "    VectorStoreIndex,\n",
        "    Settings\n",
        ")\n",
        "from llama_index.llms.huggingface import HuggingFaceLLM\n",
        "from llama_index.embeddings.huggingface import HuggingFaceEmbedding\n",
        "\n",
        "# STEP 1: Create a local text file in Google Colab\n",
        "\n",
        "text = \"\"\"\n",
        "GreenTech Solutions is a software company based in Pune, India.\n",
        "It was founded in 2020 and has 25 employees.\n",
        "Its main product, EcoTrack, helps users monitor electricity\n",
        "consumption and reduce energy waste.\n",
        "The company provides customer support from Monday to Friday.\n",
        "\"\"\"\n",
        "\n",
        "Path(\"company_info.txt\").write_text(text, encoding=\"utf-8\")\n",
        "\n",
        "# STEP 2: Configure the language model and embedding model\n",
        "\n",
        "Settings.llm = HuggingFaceLLM(\n",
        "    model_name=\"google/flan-t5-small\",\n",
        "    tokenizer_name=\"google/flan-t5-small\",\n",
        "    max_new_tokens=100,\n",
        "    device_map=\"auto\",\n",
        "    generate_kwargs={\"do_sample\": False}\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "Settings.embed_model = HuggingFaceEmbedding(\n",
