      "source": [
        "# Question 10: A legal firm wants to use AI to summarize large volumes of legal documents and retrieve relevant information quickly. Propose a solution using LangChain and LlamaIndex, and explain how it would work in practice.\n",
        "\n",
        "## Answer\n",
        "\"\"\"\n",
        "### 1. Proposed Solution\n",
        "\n",
        "I would develop a legal document assistant by combining LangChain and LlamaIndex.\n",
        "\n",
        "**LlamaIndex:** It would load legal documents, divide them into smaller chunks, create indexes and retrieve relevant information based on user queries.\n",
        "\n",
        "**LangChain:** It would manage prompt templates and use a language model to summarize documents and generate answers from the retrieved information.\n",
        "\n",
        "### 2. Working of the System\n",
        "\n",
        "1. **Document loading:** Upload legal documents in text format.\n",
        "2. **Chunking and indexing:** Divide documents into smaller sections and create embeddings using LlamaIndex.\n",
        "3. **Information retrieval:** Retrieve relevant sections when a user asks a question.\n",
        "4. **Summarization:** Use LangChain and an LLM to generate concise summaries of document sections.\n",
        "5. **Question answering:** Generate answers based on the retrieved legal information.\n",
        "6. **Human review:** A qualified legal professional verifies the output before relying on it.\n",
        "\n",
        "### 5. Real-World Challenges\n",
        "\n",
        "- **Data privacy:** Confidential legal documents must be protected against unauthorized access.\n",
        "- **Accuracy:** Incorrect summaries or answers may cause serious legal problems.\n",
        "- **Large document volume:** Processing many long documents requires efficient indexing and retrieval.\n",
        "- **Bias and reliability:** AI-generated responses may omit important clauses or misinterpret legal language.\n",
        "- **Legal compliance:** The system must follow applicable confidentiality, data protection and document-handling requirements.\n",
        "\n",
        "### Conclusion\n",
        "\n",
        "Combining LangChain and LlamaIndex can help a legal firm summarize documents and retrieve relevant information efficiently. LlamaIndex manages document indexing and retrieval, while LangChain handles summarization and answer generation. Human legal review remains essential before using the results for actual legal decisions.\n",
        "\"\"\"\n",
        "\n",
        "%pip install -q llama-index-core llama-index-readers-file llama-index-embeddings-huggingface langchain-core langchain-huggingface transformers sentence-transformers\n",
        "\n",
        "from pathlib import Path\n",
        "from llama_index.core import (\n",
        "    SimpleDirectoryReader,\n",
        "    VectorStoreIndex\n",
        ")\n",
        "from llama_index.core.node_parser import SentenceSplitter\n",
        "from llama_index.embeddings.huggingface import HuggingFaceEmbedding\n",
        "\n",
        "from transformers import pipeline\n",
        "from langchain_huggingface import HuggingFacePipeline\n",
        "from langchain_core.prompts import PromptTemplate\n",
        "from langchain_core.output_parsers import StrOutputParser\n",
        "\n",
        "# STEP 1: Create sample legal documents\n",
        "\n",
        "Path(\"legal_docs\").mkdir(exist_ok=True)\n",
        "\n",
        "Path(\"legal_docs/contract.txt\").write_text(\"\"\"\n",
        "A contract is an agreement between parties that creates\n",
        "legal obligations. Parties should understand the terms,\n",
        "payment conditions, responsibilities and termination clauses.\n",
        "Disputes may be resolved according to the agreement and\n",
        "applicable law.\n",
        "\"\"\", encoding=\"utf-8\")\n",
        "\n",
        "Path(\"legal_docs/employment.txt\").write_text(\"\"\"\n",
        "An employment agreement describes the relationship between\n",
        "an employer and an employee. It may contain information\n",
        "about salary, duties, working hours, confidentiality and\n",
        "termination. The parties should review the agreement\n",
        "before accepting its terms.\n",
        "\"\"\", encoding=\"utf-8\")\n",
        "\n",
        "# STEP 2: Load the documents using LlamaIndex\n",
        "\n",
        "documents = SimpleDirectoryReader(\n",
        "    input_dir=\"legal_docs\",\n",
        "    required_exts=[\".txt\"]\n",
        ").load_data()\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"Legal documents loaded:\", len(documents))\n",
        "\n",
        "# STEP 3: Split documents into smaller chunks\n",
        "\n",
        "splitter = SentenceSplitter(\n",
        "    chunk_size=200,\n",
        "    chunk_overlap=30\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "nodes = splitter.get_nodes_from_documents(documents)\n",
        "\n",
        "# STEP 4: Create embeddings and build the index\n",
        "\n",
        "embed_model = HuggingFaceEmbedding(\n",
        "    model_name=\"BAAI/bge-small-en-v1.5\"\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "index = VectorStoreIndex(\n",
        "    nodes,\n",
        "    embed_model=embed_model\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "retriever = index.as_retriever(similarity_top_k=3)\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"Legal document index created.\")\n",
        "\n",
        "# STEP 5: Load a local language model for LangChain\n",
        "\n",
        "hf_pipeline = pipeline(\n",
        "    \"text2text-generation\",\n",
        "    model=\"google/flan-t5-small\",\n",
        "    max_new_tokens=120,\n",
        "    do_sample=False\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "llm = HuggingFacePipeline(pipeline=hf_pipeline)\n",
        "\n",
        "# STEP 6: Create a LangChain summarization pipeline\n",
        "\n",
        "summary_prompt = PromptTemplate.from_template(\"\"\"\n",
        "Summarize the following legal document section\n",
        "in simple and concise language.\n",
        "\n",
        "Document:\n",
        "{text}\n",
        "\n",
        "Summary:\n",
        "\"\"\")\n",
        "\n",
        "summary_chain = summary_prompt | llm | StrOutputParser()\n",
        "\n",
        "# STEP 7: Summarize each document section\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"\\nDocument Summaries:\")\n",
        "\n",
        "for i, node in enumerate(nodes, start=1):\n",
        "    summary = summary_chain.invoke({\n",
        "        \"text\": node.get_content()\n",
        "    })\n",
        "\n",
        "    print(f\"\\nSection {i}:\")\n",
        "    print(summary)\n",
        "\n",
        "# STEP 8: Create a question-answering pipeline\n",
        "\n",
        "qa_prompt = PromptTemplate.from_template(\"\"\"\n",
        "Answer the question using only the legal context below.\n",
        "If the information is not available, say so.\n",
        "Do not invent legal facts.\n",
        "\n",
        "Context:\n",
        "{context}\n",
        "\n",
        "Question: {question}\n",
        "\n",
        "Answer:\n",
        "\"\"\")\n",
        "\n",
        "qa_chain = qa_prompt | llm | StrOutputParser()\n",
        "\n",
        "# STEP 9: Retrieve relevant sections and answer a question\n",
        "\n",
        "question = input(\"\\nEnter your legal question: \")\n",
        "\n",
        "results = retriever.retrieve(question)\n",
        "\n",
        "context = \"\\n\".join(\n",
        "    item.node.get_content() for item in results\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "answer = qa_chain.invoke({\n",
        "    \"context\": context,\n",
        "    \"question\": question\n",
        "})\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"\\nAnswer:\")\n",
        "print(answer)\n",
        "\n",
        "\n"
